        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Kamei aniu daeng khou bam puni,",
            "Kaniu tei kalun kumna lui puni,",
            "Raguang rui bam duanglou puni,",
            "Kaniu mikdui guai thut phuilou ngam puni.",
            "",
            "Tarina bammei guai khang,",
            "Ringhmei duikhun khou ruina tizang puni,",
            "He! Bumaeng tarimei guai rui guang zaeng diu.",
            "",
            "2. Theihpui tingmik hei naidat lak khe,",
            "Lunggeihmei le rianra rianriumei guai,",
            "Khat sini naidat pulak khe,",
            "Simei kapumna maan ngam kan puni the.",
            "",
            "3. Zau lo! Puat guai kathanhlou dat the,",
            "Heizumei lat hei nchum pui tuang e,",
            "He! Kumna akhou guang tang the,",
            "Alpha Omega, reimei le khamhmei e.",
            "",
            "4. Thaurui liangmei le nkhamh liangmei,",
            "Ringhmei thinglim khou kaniu neihlana,",
            "Namdaih khou rianramei mak khe,",
            "Nthanmei nun rui kasan gaimei su the."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
